{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55588","headline":"和翠岩和尚示後学偈 · 德谦","name":"和翠岩和尚示後学偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入门通後土，正眼密呈珠。\n当机如电拂，方免病拪芦。\n（《祖堂集》卷十，原署明照和尚，「照」应作「招」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}